{
  "device": "belly_band",
  "source": "Starter values from typical published ranges. Run scripts/build_profiles.py on the CTU-UHB dataset to replace fetal_heart_rate_bpm and uterine_activity with dataset-derived numbers. maternal_heart_rate_bpm stays a reference value (CTU-UHB does not include it).",
